<title>USA: J. Ray McDermott SA Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>J. Ray McDermott SA Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.44     loss	 $0.50</p>
<p> Net loss		  56,764     loss	18,289</p>
<p> Revs		     293,444		  287,845</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	40,538		   40,187</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.28     loss	 $0.19</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,110   profit	   187</p>
<p> Revs		   1,367,587		1,227,841</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,376		   39,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: All peridos ended March 31.</p>
<p>Q4 1997 results include non-recurring after-tax net charge $15.2 million, or $0.38 per share, for asset write-downs.</p>
<p>Fiscal 1997 results include a net non-recurring after-tax gain $12.7 million, or $0.31 per share, on assets disposals.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
